Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:14:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add double opt-in confirmation email via Resend

Every signup gets an email with a one-time confirmation link
(/api/confirm). Adds confirmed_at, confirm_token and confirm_sent_at
columns (created lazily, also in scripts/migrate.mjs). Re-sends are
throttled to once per 2 minutes. A failed send never blocks signup.

